DATA AND MODEL PROVENANCE

This project is research/educational code written against public datasets:

  * BDD100K images and labels - Berkeley DeepDrive (DDU), licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
    https://bdd-data.berkeley.edu/
    Downloaded via the Kaggle mirror `solesensei/solesensei_bdd100k`.
    The trained checkpoint is NOT redistributed here; train it yourself with
    `scripts/04_train.py`.

  * BDD100K box-track MOT ground truth (parquet), via the Kaggle mirror
    `robikscube/driving-video-with-object-tracking`. Videos and labels are
    likewise not redistributed here.

  * Detection weights: YOLOv8s pre-trained on COCO (Ultralytics, AGPL-3.0),
    fine-tuned on BDD100K. Ultralytics is a separate dependency with its own
    licence; this repository's own code is MIT.

  * No BDD100K images, videos or label files are committed to this repository.
    `results/` contains only derived metrics, plots and the authors' own
    annotations-on-plots figures.

NOTE ON THE MIT LICENCE AND THE `src/` MODULES: the MIT licence above covers
this repository's own code only. Ultralytics, which this project calls as a
library, is AGPL-3.0. If you redistribute a combined work or a service that
embeds Ultralytics, review those terms.
